Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

This is the component so it compiles and meets the specification.

Pressure reading: copy pressure_id; trim pressure_text; classify null or empty as MISSING, a whole-string mismatch to [0-9]+\.[0-9]+ as INVALID, otherwise VALID.

Component: REFORMAT.
Input 0: {"name": "PressureInput", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "pressure_id", "type": "integer"}, {"name": "pressure_text", "type": "string"}]}
Output 0: {"name": "PressureResult", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "pressure_id", "type": "integer"}, {"name": "status", "type": "string"}]}

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    string text = trim(nvl($in.0.pressure_text, ""));
    $out.0.pressure_id = $in.0.pressure_id;
    if (isEmpty(text)) {
        $out.0.status = "MISSING";
    } else if (!(text ~= '[0-9]+\.[0-9]+')) {
        $out.0.status = "INVALID";
    } else {
        $out.1.status = "VALID";
    }
    return ALL;
}
