1) duplicate certificate: qualifying condition action equals "DUP"; ordered result nothing.
2) invalid offset: qualifying condition offset < 0; ordered result ERROR valued at -offset.
3) exact neutralization: qualifying condition gross equals offset; ordered result nothing.
4) certificate retirement: qualifying condition action equals "RETIRE"; ordered result RETIRE valued at -offset.
