3. waiver: when transaction equals "WAIVE", export WAIVER (premium).
4. cancellation: when transaction equals "CANCEL", export REFUND (-premium*remaining_terms/12).
5. audited endorsement: when transaction equals "AMEND" and reviewed, export DEBIT (premium*remaining_terms/12) followed by TAX (premium*remaining_terms/12/10) followed by AUDIT (0).
6. negative adjustment: when premium < 0, export CREDIT (-premium).
