The Normalizer CTL2 for this complete event-posting policy.

For manufacturing inspection and recovery, choose the earliest eligible treatment below. Every treatment lists its complete ordered payload.

[impossible production] eligibility: planned < 0 or actual < 0 or scrap < 0 or scrap > actual; result: ERROR {units=0, quality_grade=null, released=false}.
[missing inspection] eligibility: quality equals null; result: HOLD {units=actual, quality_grade=null, released=false}.
[batch cancellation] eligibility: quality equals "CANCEL"; result: no postings.
[rejected grade without recovery] eligibility: quality equals "REJECT" and not rework_allowed; result: SCRAP {units=actual, quality_grade=quality, released=false}.
[recoverable rejected grade] eligibility: quality equals "REJECT"; result: GOOD {units=accepted/3, quality_grade=quality, released=true}; then REWORK {units=accepted-accepted/3, quality_grade=quality, released=false}; then SCRAP {units=scrap, quality_grade=quality, released=false}.
