Build event expansion for the invoice fiscal export feed, applying the first matching test. Keep listed postings in order.

1) superseded invoice: qualifying condition document_kind equals "SUPERSEDED"; ordered result nothing.
2) invalid tax: qualifying condition tax < 0; ordered result ERROR valued at -tax.
3) free sample: qualifying condition document_kind equals "SAMPLE"; ordered result SAMPLE valued at 0.
4) credit note: qualifying condition base < 0; ordered result CREDIT valued at base+tax.
5) discounted audited sale: qualifying condition document_kind equals "DISCOUNT" and audited; ordered result NET valued at base*(100-20)/100, then TAX valued at tax, then AUDIT valued at 0.
6) tax exempt: qualifying condition document_kind equals "EXEMPT"; ordered result EXEMPT valued at base.
7) discounted sale: qualifying condition document_kind equals "DISCOUNT"; ordered result NET valued at base*(100-20)/100, then TAX valued at tax.
8) standard sale: qualifying condition none of the preceding conditions applies; ordered result GROSS valued at base+tax.

Input 0 (In_invoice_decomposition_2): external_invoice_id uses string with mandatory content | base uses decimal with mandatory content | audited uses boolean with mandatory content | document_kind uses string with mandatory content | tax uses decimal with mandatory content | comment uses string with optional content.
Output 0 (Out_invoice_decomposition_2): parent_invoice_ref uses string with mandatory content | tax_line uses string with mandatory content | amount uses decimal with mandatory content.
Each source ID is unique; carry external_invoice_id into parent_invoice_ref. Entry labels go in tax_line, values in amount.

```ctl
//#CTL2
string invoice_reference;
string[] invoice_actions = [];
decimal[] invoice_values = [];
function void post_invoice(string label, decimal value) {
    append(invoice_actions, label);
    append(invoice_values, value);
}
function integer count() {
    invoice_actions = [];
    invoice_values = [];
    invoice_reference = $in.0.external_invoice_id;
    /* Priority table:
       1. superseded invoice -> 0 rows
       2. invalid tax -> 1 rows
       3. free sample -> 1 rows
       4. credit note -> 1 rows
       5. discounted audited sale -> 3 rows
       6. tax exempt -> 1 rows
       7. discounted sale -> 2 rows
       8. standard sale -> 1 rows
    */
    if ($in.0.document_kind == "SUPERSEDED") {
        return 0; // superseded invoice
    }
    else if ($in.0.tax < 0d) {
        post_invoice("ERROR", -$in.0.tax);
        return 1; // invalid tax
    }
    else if ($in.0.document_kind == "SAMPLE") {
        post_invoice("SAMPLE", 0d);
        return 1; // free sample
    }
    else if ($in.0.base < 0d) {
        post_invoice("CREDIT", $in.0.base+$in.0.tax);
        return 1; // credit note
    }
    else if ($in.0.document_kind == "DISCOUNT" && $in.0.audited) {
        post_invoice("NET", $in.0.base*(100d-20d)/100d);
        post_invoice("TAX", $in.0.tax);
        post_invoice("AUDIT", 0d);
        return 3; // discounted audited sale
    }
    else if ($in.0.document_kind == "EXEMPT") {
        post_invoice("EXEMPT", $in.0.base);
        return 1; // tax exempt
    }
    else if ($in.0.document_kind == "DISCOUNT") {
        post_invoice("NET", $in.0.base*(100d-20d)/100d);
        post_invoice("TAX", $in.0.tax);
        return 2; // discounted sale
    }
    else if (true) {
        post_invoice("GROSS", $in.0.base+$in.0.tax);
        return 1; // standard sale
    }
    return 0;
}
function integer transform(integer idx) {
    $out.0.parentinvoice_ref = invoice_reference;
    $out.0.tax_line = invoice_actions[idx];
    $out.0.amount = invoice_values[idx];
    return ALL;
}
