6) For insufficient match (match < award/5), the event produces HOLD valued at award-match.
7) For consortium payout (stage equals "CONSORTIUM"), the event produces LEAD valued at award*50/100, then PARTNER valued at award*(100-50)/100.
8) For direct payment (none of the preceding conditions applies), the event produces PAYMENT valued at award+match.

