6) large audited move: qualifying condition requested >= 15 and trace; ordered result OUT valued at -requested, then IN valued at requested, then TRACE valued at 0.
7) ordinary paired move: qualifying condition ticket equals "MOVE"; ordered result OUT valued at -requested, then IN valued at requested.
8) inventory sample: qualifying condition none of the preceding conditions applies; ordered result SAMPLE valued at requested, then RESERVE valued at available.

