5) exposure > posted*0.8 and review means EXISTING valued at posted*0.8, then CALL valued at exposure-posted*0.8, then AUDIT valued at 0, under the reviewed shortage treatment.
6) posted*0.8 > exposure means RELEASE valued at exposure/0.8-posted, under the surplus release treatment.
7) exposure > posted*0.8 means CALL valued at exposure-posted*0.8, under the unreviewed shortage treatment.
8) none of the preceding conditions applies means BALANCED valued at 0, under the balanced agreement treatment.

