Shared bicycle station balances require this behavior: Sum signed known movements and report the absolute net movement. Ignore missing movement values. Before applying that calculation, treat each missing movement as 3.
The complete grouping key is bicycle_station. Preserve order within each adjacent block.
Input:
SignedMovementsInput: bicycle_station string nullable=false; movement decimal.
Accumulator:
SignedMovementsState: balance decimal.
Output 0:
SignedMovementsSummary: bicycle_station string nullable=false; result decimal nullable=true.

```ctl
//#CTL2
function void initGroup(SignedMovementsState acc) {
    acc.balance = 0D;
}
function boolean updateGroup(SignedMovementsState acc) {
    if (true) acc.balance += nvl($in.0.movement, 3D);
    return false;
}
function integer updateTransform(integer counter, SignedMovementsState acc) {
    return SKIP;
}
function boolean finishGroup(SignedMovementsState acc) {
    return true;
}
function integer transform(integer counter, SignedMovementsState acc) {
    if (counter > 0) return SKIP;
    $out.0.bicyclestation = $in.0.bicycle_station;
    $out.0.result = acc.balance < 0D ? -acc.balance : acc.balance;
    return ALL;
}
