The Normalizer CTL2 for this complete event-posting policy.

For parcel safety and transport scheduling, choose the earliest eligible treatment below. Every treatment lists its complete ordered payload.

[invalid dimensions] eligibility: length_cm <= 0 or width_cm <= 0 or height_cm <= 0 or weight_kg <= 0; result: REJECT {endpoint=null, kg=0, due_at=dispatch_at plus 0 elapsed hours, requires_signature=false}.
[unknown destination] eligibility: destination equals null; result: HOLD {endpoint=null, kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at plus 0 elapsed hours, requires_signature=false}.
[dangerous goods] eligibility: hazardous; result: SCREEN {endpoint="HAZMAT", kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at plus 0 elapsed hours, requires_signature=true}; then HAZMAT {endpoint=destination, kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at plus 48 elapsed hours, requires_signature=true}; then CERTIFY {endpoint=destination, kg=0, due_at=dispatch_at plus 48 elapsed hours, requires_signature=true}.
[oversize or overweight] eligibility: girth > 180 or weight_kg > 30; result: FREIGHT {endpoint=destination, kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at plus 72 elapsed hours, requires_signature=signature}.
[dispatch window expired] eligibility: dispatch_at > cutoff_at; result: no postings.
[reviewed normal route] eligibility: review; result: LINEHAUL {endpoint=destination, kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at plus 24 elapsed hours, requires_signature=signature}; then AUDIT {endpoint=destination, kg=0, due_at=dispatch_at plus 0 elapsed hours, requires_signature=false}.
[ordinary parcel] eligibility: otherwise; result: PICKUP {endpoint="LOCAL", kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at, requires_signature=signature}; then HUB {endpoint="REGIONAL", kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at plus 24 elapsed hours, requires_signature=signature}; then DELIVER {endpoint=destination, kg=weight_kg, due_at=dispatch_at plus 48 elapsed hours, requires_signature=signature}.

For dimensional screening, girth = length_cm + 2*(width_cm + height_cm). Route-hour offsets measure elapsed time from dispatch_at, including the March daylight-saving boundary. Payload kg describes one parcel on each leg, so transport legs do not add together as inventory quantities. Mandatory hazard signatures override the original preference.

