The Normalizer CTL2 for this complete event-posting policy.

For subscription activation and renewal billing, choose the earliest eligible treatment below. Every treatment lists its complete ordered payload.

[duplicate event] eligibility: event equals "DUP"; result: no postings.
[missing replacement plan] eligibility: (event equals "NEW" or event equals "UPGRADE") and new_plan equals null; result: REJECT {plan=null, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}.
[pause instruction] eligibility: event equals "PAUSE"; result: PAUSE {plan=old_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}.
[already covered renewal] eligibility: event equals "RENEW" and paid_through differs from null and effective_at <= paid_through; result: no postings.
[unchanged with audit] eligibility: old_plan equals new_plan and old_fee equals new_fee and audit; result: AUDIT {plan=old_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[unchanged without audit] eligibility: old_plan equals new_plan and old_fee equals new_fee; result: no postings.
[new subscription] eligibility: event equals "NEW"; result: ACTIVATE {plan=new_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}; then INVOICE {plan=new_plan, charge=new_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}; then WELCOME {plan=new_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[reviewed migration] eligibility: event equals "UPGRADE" and audit; result: CLOSE {plan=old_plan, charge=-old_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}; then AUDIT {plan=new_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}; then OPEN {plan=new_plan, charge=new_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[migration without review] eligibility: event equals "UPGRADE"; result: CLOSE {plan=old_plan, charge=-old_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}; then OPEN {plan=new_plan, charge=new_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[ordinary renewal] eligibility: otherwise; result: CHARGE {plan=old_plan, charge=old_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.

