prompt:
Validate this Normalizer transform against its metadata and requirements.

The Normalizer CTL2 for this complete event-posting policy.

For loyalty balance mutation and expiry, choose the earliest eligible treatment below. Every treatment lists its complete ordered payload.

[unknown member] eligibility: member_token equals null; result: UNMATCHED {delta=0, remaining=balance, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}.
[cancelled activity] eligibility: activity equals "CANCEL"; result: no postings.
[invalid movement] eligibility: earned < 0 or redeemed < 0; result: ERROR {delta=0, remaining=balance, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}.
[expired balance] eligibility: expires_on differs from null and expires_on <= as_of and balance > 0; result: EXPIRE {delta=-balance, remaining=0, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}; then BALANCE {delta=0, remaining=0, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}; then NOTICE {delta=0, remaining=0, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}.
[insufficient points] eligibility: redeemed > balance+earned; result: HOLD {delta=0, remaining=balance, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}.
[reviewed bonus] eligibility: activity equals "BONUS" and review; result: EARN {delta=earned, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}; then AUDIT {delta=0, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}; then BONUS {delta=earned*4, remaining=balance+earned*5, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}.
[simultaneous earn and spend] eligibility: earned > 0 and redeemed > 0; result: EARN {delta=earned, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}; then SPEND {delta=-redeemed, remaining=balance+earned-redeemed, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}; then BALANCE {delta=0, remaining=balance+earned-redeemed, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}.
[positive earning] eligibility: earned > 0; result: EARN {delta=earned, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}.
[remaining movement] eligibility: otherwise; result: SPEND {delta=-redeemed, remaining=balance-redeemed, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}.

Amounts are indivisible points, with resulting balances held as longs. Preserve expires_on in valid_until even when absent. Expiry and as_of use UTC instants. Expired balances require a review NOTICE; simultaneous earning and redemption keep all three ordered movements.

Input 0 Source_loyalty_2: activity_id / required / string; member_token / nullability omitted / string; activity / required / string; earned / required / integer; redeemed / required / integer; balance / required / long; expires_on / nullable / date; as_of / required / date; review / required / boolean.
Output 0 Posting_loyalty_2: source_activity_id / required / string; point_action / required / string; delta / required / long; remaining / required / long; valid_until / nullable / date; needs_review / required / boolean.
Source activity_id values are unique. Preserve each in source_activity_id on its postings.

