prompt:
Validate this Normalizer transform against its metadata and requirements.

The Normalizer CTL2 for this complete event-posting policy.

For subscription activation and renewal billing, choose the earliest eligible treatment below. Every treatment lists its complete ordered payload.

[duplicate event] eligibility: event equals "DUP"; result: no postings.
[missing replacement plan] eligibility: (event equals "NEW" or event equals "UPGRADE") and new_plan equals null; result: REJECT {plan=null, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}.
[pause instruction] eligibility: event equals "PAUSE"; result: PAUSE {plan=old_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}.
[already covered renewal] eligibility: event equals "RENEW" and paid_through differs from null and effective_at <= paid_through; result: no postings.
[unchanged with audit] eligibility: old_plan equals new_plan and old_fee equals new_fee and audit; result: AUDIT {plan=old_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[unchanged without audit] eligibility: old_plan equals new_plan and old_fee equals new_fee; result: no postings.
[new subscription] eligibility: event equals "NEW"; result: ACTIVATE {plan=new_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}; then INVOICE {plan=new_plan, charge=new_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}; then WELCOME {plan=new_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[reviewed migration] eligibility: event equals "UPGRADE" and audit; result: CLOSE {plan=old_plan, charge=-old_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}; then AUDIT {plan=new_plan, charge=0, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}; then OPEN {plan=new_plan, charge=new_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[migration without review] eligibility: event equals "UPGRADE"; result: CLOSE {plan=old_plan, charge=-old_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=false}; then OPEN {plan=new_plan, charge=new_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.
[ordinary renewal] eligibility: otherwise; result: CHARGE {plan=old_plan, charge=old_fee, effective_on=effective_at, active=true}.

Timestamp equality counts as already covered by paid_through. Every posting carries the event effective_at date. Absent plan identifiers participate in equality like other values; compare monetary fees exactly.

Input 0 Source_subscription_2: event_id / required / string; event / required / string; old_plan / nullable / string; new_plan / nullability omitted / string; old_fee / required / decimal; new_fee / required / decimal; paid_through / nullable / date; effective_at / required / date; audit / required / boolean.
Output 0 Posting_subscription_2: source_event_id / required / string; billing_action / required / string; plan / nullable / string; charge / required / decimal; effective_on / required / date; active / required / boolean.
Source event_id values are unique. Preserve each in source_event_id on its postings.

```ctl
//#CTL2
string subscription_2_source;
string[] subscription_2_billing_action_rows = [];
string[] subscription_2_plan_rows = [];
decimal[] subscription_2_charge_rows = [];
date[] subscription_2_effective_on_rows = [];
boolean[] subscription_2_active_rows = [];
function void stage_subscription_2(string p0, string p1, decimal p2, date p3, boolean p4) {
    append(subscription_2_billing_action_rows, p0);
    append(subscription_2_plan_rows, p1);
    append(subscription_2_charge_rows, p2);
    append(subscription_2_effective_on_rows, p3);
    append(subscription_2_active_rows, p4);
}
function integer count() {
    subscription_2_billing_action_rows = [];
    subscription_2_plan_rows = [];
    subscription_2_charge_rows = [];
    subscription_2_effective_on_rows = [];
    subscription_2_active_rows = [];
    subscription_2_source = $in.0.event_id;
    /* Branch census:
       1. duplicate event -> 0 rows
       2. missing replacement plan -> 1 rows
       3. pause instruction -> 1 rows
       4. already covered renewal -> 0 rows
       5. unchanged with audit -> 1 rows
       6. unchanged without audit -> 0 rows
       7. new subscription -> 3 rows
       8. reviewed migration -> 3 rows
       9. migration without review -> 2 rows
       10. ordinary renewal -> 1 rows
    */
    if ($in.0.event == "DUP") {
        return 0; // duplicate event
    }
    else if (($in.0.event == "NEW" || $in.0.event == "UPGRADE") && $in.0.new_plan == null) {
        stage_subscription_2("REJECT", null, 0d, $in.0.effective_at, false);
        return 1; // missing replacement plan
    }
    else if ($in.0.event == "PAUSE") {
        stage_subscription_2("PAUSE", $in.0.old_plan, 0d, $in.0.effective_at, false);
        return 1; // pause instruction
    }
    else if ($in.0.event == "RENEW" && $in.0.effective_at <= $in.0.paid_through) {
        return 0; // already covered renewal
    }
    else if ($in.0.old_plan == $in.0.new_plan && $in.0.old_fee == $in.0.new_fee && $in.0.audit) {
        stage_subscription_2("AUDIT", $in.0.old_plan, 0d, $in.0.effective_at, true);
        return 1; // unchanged with audit
    }
    else if ($in.0.old_plan == $in.0.new_plan && $in.0.old_fee == $in.0.new_fee) {
        return 0; // unchanged without audit
    }
    else if ($in.0.event == "NEW") {
        stage_subscription_2("ACTIVATE", $in.0.new_plan, 0d, $in.0.effective_at, true);
        stage_subscription_2("INVOICE", $in.0.new_plan, $in.0.new_fee, $in.0.effective_at, true);
        stage_subscription_2("WELCOME", $in.0.new_plan, 0d, $in.0.effective_at, true);
        return 3; // new subscription
    }
    else if ($in.0.event == "UPGRADE" && $in.0.audit) {
        stage_subscription_2("CLOSE", $in.0.old_plan, -$in.0.old_fee, $in.0.effective_at, false);
        stage_subscription_2("AUDIT", $in.0.new_plan, 0d, $in.0.effective_at, false);
        stage_subscription_2("OPEN", $in.0.new_plan, $in.0.new_fee, $in.0.effective_at, true);
        return 3; // reviewed migration
    }
    else if ($in.0.event == "UPGRADE") {
        stage_subscription_2("CLOSE", $in.0.old_plan, -$in.0.old_fee, $in.0.effective_at, false);
        stage_subscription_2("OPEN", $in.0.new_plan, $in.0.new_fee, $in.0.effective_at, true);
        return 2; // migration without review
    }
    else if (true) {
        stage_subscription_2("CHARGE", $in.0.old_plan, $in.0.old_fee, $in.0.effective_at, true);
        return 1; // ordinary renewal
    }
    return 0;
}
function integer transform(integer idx) {
    $out.0.source_event_id = subscription_2_source;
    $out.0.billing_action = subscription_2_billing_action_rows[idx];
    $out.0.plan = subscription_2_plan_rows[idx];
