Implement archive ingest lot reporting. Use a Rollup grouped by ingest_lot, with adjacent groups processed in input order. Input ArchiveObservation(ingest_lot:string, box_ref:string, catalogued_at:date, sheets:decimal, quality:string). Accumulator metadata is fixed at ArchiveAccumulator(sum_value:decimal, seen:integer); all metadata listed here is final. Output ArchiveSummary(ingest_lot:string, first_ref:string, last_ref:string, first_year:integer, last_year:integer, accepted:integer, missing:integer, negative:integer, primary_count:integer, secondary_count:integer, minimum:decimal, maximum:decimal, total:decimal, mean_value:decimal, disposition:string, audit_text:string). Save the first and last box_ref (including null) and their UTC calendar years; a null timestamp yields a null year. Classify quality into PRIMARY, SECONDARY or other. Exclude negative and null sheets from accepted, min, max, total and mean; zero qualifies. Count missing and negative observations separately. The average is rounded to two places, null without accepted values. Disposition is EMPTY without accepted values, otherwise REVIEW when anything is missing or negative, else READY. Join every box_ref in encounter order with commas, substituting ? for null. Emit one summary per group, no intermediate rows.

```ctl
