Build event expansion for the carbon allowance settlement feed, applying the first matching test. Keep listed postings in order.

1) duplicate certificate: qualifying condition action equals "DUP"; ordered result nothing.
2) invalid offset: qualifying condition offset < 0; ordered result ERROR valued at -offset.
3) exact neutralization: qualifying condition gross equals offset; ordered result nothing.
4) certificate retirement: qualifying condition action equals "RETIRE"; ordered result RETIRE valued at -offset.
5) reviewed surplus: qualifying condition offset > gross and review; ordered result GROSS valued at gross, then OFFSET valued at -offset, then AUDIT valued at 0.
6) allowance breach: qualifying condition gross-offset > 100; ordered result EXCESS valued at gross-offset-100.
7) offset surplus: qualifying condition offset > gross; ordered result SURPLUS valued at offset-gross.
8) net liability: qualifying condition none of the preceding conditions applies; ordered result NET valued at gross-offset.

Input 0 (In_emissions_netting_2): external_certificate_id has string type (required) | gross has decimal type (required) | review has boolean type (required) | action has string type (required) | offset has decimal type (required) | issuer_note has string type (nullable).
Output 0 (Out_emissions_netting_2): parent_certificate_ref has string type (required) | carbon_leg has string type (required) | tonnes has decimal type (required).
